rted winter heaters"}, "de": {"name": "Verschiedene Heizgeräte für den Winter"}}}, {"id": "f67414ac-b8aa-589a-9298-e883a38d376e", "name": "جاط تقديم عسلي مزخرف", "description": "وعاء تقديم شفاف باللون العسلي، بحافة متموجة ونقوش بارزة.", "section": "أدوات ضيافة", "image": "https://damascus-shop.com/images/happy-house/20261101/29915.jpg", "translations": {"en": {"name": "Decorative amber-coloured serving bowl"}, "de": {"name": "Verzierte honigfarbene Servierschale"}}}]$products$::jsonb)
